Error [E0102]: `Event.emit_async` was retired
  --> tests/ui/event_emit_async_retired.jet:5:10
    |
  5 |     jobs.emit_async(1)
    |          ^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: synchronous `Event<T>` dispatches immediately; only `AsyncEvent<T, E>` owns a scheduler queue
 Fix: construct an `AsyncEvent<T, E>` with `event.async_result`, then call `.emit_async(payload)`
